          "author": "The Mik Maks",
          "description": "Learn, Play, Grow is packed with family fun and playful learning - perfect for curious young minds.  Written and performed by educators, this Yoto Card features catchy and educational songs such as Eye Spy Game, You Can Find Shapes and The Opposite Song.  Each song encourages children to explore the world around them through movement and musical discovery.  Learn, Play, Grow is a thoughtful blend of The Mik Maks most inspiring songs for passive independent learning (hiding the vegetables in the bolognaise)",
